{
  "id": "e04",
  "rule": "the media collection: every row of the statuses asked is read and counted (X-WP-Total, X-WP-TotalPages, Link), the rows the caller may not read (or edit, in the edit context) are left out of the body only; a library of images, a PDF, two MP3s, attachments of a published post, a draft, a private post, a trashed post and a qp_hidden post (outside REST), unattached ones and a private one, listed as anonymous, erin, carol and alice; the status rules, the type filters as a union of the allowed types, the search of the stored file path, the parent filters with 0 for the unattached, the other filters and orders, the ordering and paging errors, the edit context refusal, HEAD, one set of audio player numbers per response, and the links and embeds of listed attachments. Revisit req24 (search=2026, the year folder): targets cannot name the run's year, so from 2027 on both sides find nothing there and it only checks an empty answer; a run whose setup crosses New Year's midnight can file the two sides' uploads in different years",
